DH-Waypoint
===========

This product was originally derived from `bitmagnet-io/bitmagnet`
(https://github.com/bitmagnet-io/bitmagnet), which is licensed under
the MIT License. A copy of that license is included in this
distribution as LICENSE; it covers both the upstream code retained in
this fork and the modifications made under the DH-Waypoint project.

The DH-Waypoint fork was created on 2026-04-20 and rebranded from
"bitmagnet" to "DH-Waypoint" on 2026-04-24 once upstream dormancy made
continued "fork" framing inaccurate. Significant portions of the original `bitmagnet-io/bitmagnet`
code are still present unmodified or near-unmodified; significant
portions are new work under the DH-Waypoint project. We do not separate
copyright lines per file — the project-level MIT License covers the
combined work, and contribution attribution is tracked via git history.

